                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "K'apar g'aŋwen ma dwe marapena, wilatimo Kalima ma Kadho, aka wilacamo mugat ma buthow ma ndelo abirio. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I ndelo no wod kere lamiyo rwath paka mic ma cwako reco pere kodi ri ji ma lowo je. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I ndelo abirio ma kalima go lamiyo mic awaŋa ri Rwoth. Rwath abirio, wot rombo abirio ma jongoye gi ŋolo kisi ndelo kodi wod diel kisi ndelo ri mic ma cwako reco. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ri kisi rwath acel kodi wod rombo acel m'icowere gine, ripo wobedi mic ma lita apar g'ario g'adec ma duma kodi lita adek ma mo oliv. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.24"
            ]
          }
